\contentsline {table}{\numberline {B.2}{\ignorespaces AUC-ROC by train-test regime. TSTR is the headline downstream utility regime. TRTS assesses whether the synthetic test split is realistic for a classifier trained on real data. TSTS assesses internal synthetic consistency. Values above the real reference in the TSTS regime may reflect an over-regular synthetic distribution rather than superior utility.}}{94}{table.caption.113}%
